<title>USA: Waukesha Cty ATCD, Wisc., won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Waukesha Cty ATCD, Wisc., won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said it won $2.7 million of Waukesha Cty Area Technical College Dist, Wisc., general obligation promissory notes, Series 1996 C, with a true interest cost of 4.51 percent.</p>
</text>
